  "published": "2026-10-23T09:57:15Z",
  "releaseNotes": "/// <summary>\n/// Disk index of immutable segments (Lucene/FTS5 scheme): compressed postings with skip tables,\n/// positions only for the configured fields, columns for dates and lengths, BM25 relevance.\n/// Field texts are not stored: documents are returned with metadata only.\n/// </summary>\n/// <remarks>\n/// Writes go to a write-ahead log and an in-memory buffer (searchable at once); the buffer is\n/// written to a new segment by size or time, and a commit file <c>segments_N</c> makes it durable.\n/// Segments are merged in the background. Parts: SegmentDocumentIndex.Write.cs (writes, flush, commit),\n/// SegmentDocumentIndex.Read.cs (search and reads), SegmentDocumentIndex.Merge.cs (merging).",
